      "raw": "<p>The promos have been giving out as part of their Kickstarter and pre-orders (with a couple being given out in different ways). Right now, the only way to get &quot;official ones&quot; is to get them at a convention, and even then, you won&#39;t be able to get them all.</p><p>The cards themselves simply replace the hero card used in each deck. Since the cards are not actually in the deck, you don&#39;t need them to be actual cards. GtG has made the content of the cards available. So you can either just write down the info, or print out your own cards.&nbsp;</p><p>You can find the abilities under each hero in the <a href=\"http://sotm.wikidot.com/\">SotM wiki</a>&nbsp;and on <a href=\"http://geekdo.com/videogame/167677/sentinels-multiverse\">BGG</a>.</p><p>Once the last expansion comes out, GtG will sell promo packs that will include all the promos.</p>",
