      "created_at": "2015-08-11T04:28:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you're still looking for printables, our very own Spiff made a website that has a whole bunch of cool stuff that you could print out, including the promos on his 'Print &amp; Play Game Accessories' tab located at the right of the main page.</p><p>Here's his site: http://www.spiffworld.com/sotm/</p>",
